      {
        "body": "- Add portable setup through any Notis-connected assistant.\n- Bundle complete workflows and explicitly fictional demonstration data.\n- Refresh Store media and consistent app naming.\n- Preserve private account data and require installer choices for optional automations.",
        "date": "2026-09-22",
